    "reasoning": "What the evidence shows: Four tutors in audio_batch_06 report that the LT player never loads or audio will not play, and ask whether to QN the task. At least one report describes a waveform that loads while Play never starts sound. The FAQ answers the never-loading player case but has no entry for a visible waveform with no playback. The August batch-05 one-reload trial restored playback in two of six attempts, did not provide a dependable workaround, and its posted guidance expired on August 28. Thread status, read from each thread's own messages: partially resolved ×2, unresolved ×2. Agent 1's earlier labels (an input, not evidence): partially resolved ×1, unresolved ×3; 2 of 4 were not verified by Agent 1. 3 advisor statements were not supported by the evidence and not shown.",
